# Notification System for Order Ready Alerts

## Backend Development
- [ ] Create notification service module with SMS and email providers
- [ ] Implement SMS service integration (Twilio/SendGrid/etc.)
- [ ] Implement email service integration (SendGrid/Mailgun/etc.)
- [ ] Add notification preferences to customer profile (SMS only, email only, both, none)
- [ ] Create notification templates for order ready messages
- [ ] Update order status API to trigger notifications when status changes to "ready"
- [ ] Add notification history/logging to database
